00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:29.040
Um, that's, that's still impressive.

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:31.440
Yeah, and I think that's well put.

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:38.120
Uh, I think you do have to, uh, describe how small that screen where the actual gameplay happens, though.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:45.000
Because we have had in the past, we have had games that, you know, to, to add more definition to the area,

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:52.900
they kind of create a smaller screen with some menus around it in order to, uh, you know, maximize, uh, the graphics.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:07:01.220
